body:
### Operating System

10

### Programming Languages

PHP

### CCXT Version

4.3.73

### Description

Since today an error started to appear when requesting a balance from KuCoin exchange:
ccxt\InvalidNonce
kucoin Invalid KC-API-TIMESTAMP

The method `$exchange->load_time_difference();` does not help

### Code

```PHP
$exchangeClass = "\\ccxt\\kucoin";
$exchange      = new $exchangeClass([
  'apiKey'   => $account['api_key'],
  'secret'   => $account['api_secret'],
  'password' => $account['api_password'],
]);

$timeDifference = $exchange->load_time_difference();
// print_r($timeDifference); // returns: 5528

$balance = $exchange->fetchBalance([
  'type' => 'trade',
]);
print_r($balance);
// ccxt\InvalidNonce
// kucoin Invalid KC-API-TIMESTAMP
```
